    "updated_at": "2024-12-18T16:18:46Z",
    "body": "What happens when an element is inserted from another document? \r\n\r\nToday it is upgraded with the adopted document's registry. It seems like since these elements would generally have a specified `customElements`, they would not upgrade? If so, this would likely introduce a compatibility issue.",
