    "created_at": "2024-12-18T16:33:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-12-18T16:33:46Z",
    "body": "In most scenarios those other documents don't have a browsing context so will end up with a null registry, but for `iframe` and such there would indeed be a change in behavior for elements that haven't upgraded yet. We'd have to experiment with that, but one solution if it's problematic would be to reset non-scoped registries of non-upgraded elements as well. A bit ugly, but not the end of the world.",
