    "created_at": "2024-12-19T14:25:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-12-19T14:25:05Z",
    "body": "> I don't really understand your cross-document concern.\r\n\r\nJust hoping to ensure we're covering it well. Mostly I wanted to make sure template cloning would be ok since this is a framework [hot path](https://github.com/sveltejs/svelte/blob/main/packages/svelte/src/internal/client/dom/template.js#L51), but we've also seen a surprising interest in moving custom elements between documents, e.g. with the [PIP api](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document_Picture-in-Picture_API).",
